WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.400
<b>Dai Shogun</b>

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.400
<b>Great Revolution</b>

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:08.040
Hear my words, Takemikazuchi.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:13.450
The dark power that boils within 
me shall vanquish the light.

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:15.280
Yes.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:20.790
When you become an Onigami 
of rage, and devour Susanoo,

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.540
my wish will come true.

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:31.160
Keiichiro-sama...

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:39.600
<b>Nagasaki</b>

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:52.030
Wait for me, Kiriko!

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:01.490
The men possessed by the Onigami are 
fighting for the shrine priestess.

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:03.040
Excellent.

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:09.600
This boring world will finally see a little chaos.

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:14.670
<b>Nagasaki</b>

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:16.220
<b>Episode 12: 
Break the Thunderclouds, 
Heavenly Thunder God Susanoo!</b>

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>This is a story of monsters, 
told in the land of the rising sun.</i>

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:22.520
<i>It began 21 years ago, with the 
extermination of the Black Ships.</i>

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:39.410
<i>And once again, Hitotsubashi Shigeyoshi, 
piloting the Onigami Takemikazuchi,</i>

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:42.460
<i>has engulfed the seas of Nagasaki with hellfire,</i>

00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:44.740
<i>and shed the blood of the people.</i>

00:01:58.330 --> 00:01:59.720
Kon-chan, Hii-chan, over there!

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:02.470
That's Susanoo.

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:03.720
What?

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:07.520
It still hasn't had enough, after 
getting the crap kicked out of it?

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:09.310
Attack!

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:15.110
Shall we report it?

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:18.400
No need to trouble Shigeyoshi-sama with that.

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:20.820
Kon-chan, that's the spirit.

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:22.530
Let's do it.

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:37.010
You've got guts showing yourself here, punk.

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:39.010
The Shinsengumi will fight you.

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:41.470
You won't get any farther.

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:43.350
I don't have time for this!

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:47.100
Get out of the way!

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:55.770
Don't mess with the Shinsengumi!

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:57.610
You don't even have a weapon.

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:08.040
Sorry, but this is the end.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:14.040
You're going to die here!

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:18.380
Who's there?

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:35.150
Nice hit, Ryoma!

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:37.360
Your fight is with us!

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:40.030
Maika, hit 'em hard!

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:41.310
Right!

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:53.750
What? An airship?

00:03:54.740 --> 00:03:56.130
Who are they?

00:03:56.450 --> 00:03:57.680
It doesn't matter.

00:03:57.680 --> 00:03:59.630
If they're trying to stop us, we'll kill them!

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:10.120
Mr. Best in Japan!

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:12.610
It's up to you to bring the dawn to Japan.

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:14.310
Old man...

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:16.480
We'll handle them.

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:18.980
You save Kiriko.

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:20.340
Thanks!

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:28.160
What?

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:35.120
Wait for me, Kiriko!

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:39.090
I won't let you!

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:49.610
Hyogo, that's the Shinsengumi!

00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:52.310
Yeah. But we must keep going.

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:55.390
But they're the ones you're trying to kill...

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:58.130
What's important now is Kiriko-dono!

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.220
Why?

00:05:03.090 --> 00:05:05.200
Why are you doing this?

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:07.630
You're the key.

00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:12.810
You can make men's blood boil, 
and awaken the darkness within them.

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:17.960
You are the shrine priestess who receives 
the karma of humans and demons.

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:19.920
You...

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:28.110
It's sweet...

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:31.620
I'm so bored, I can't stand it.

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:34.390
Are you afraid of death?

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.720
How sad.

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:40.860
Death is our salvation.

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:44.860
Many of us spend several centuries 
of our lives in boredom.

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:50.410
But I don't like boredom.

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:53.860
Is that why you...

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:55.910
Don't you understand?

00:05:55.910 --> 00:06:00.920
Your lives are like bubbles, 
appearing and popping a moment later.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:03.130
They only last a few decades.

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:07.630
The foolish lust those humans obsess over,

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:09.550
the power, the fantasies...

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:12.400
Because our lives are short and ephemeral,

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:14.470
we can see what's really important!

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:16.850
Then show me.

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:21.010
Show me the moment when 
a human's life shines.

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:23.020
The light just before their lives burn out.

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:34.740
It shot through?

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:38.250
So close!

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:40.250
A new type of gun?

00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:45.270
Maika, aim for their steam boiler!

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:46.610
That's their weak spot!

00:06:46.610 --> 00:06:47.710
Right!

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:50.340
With your skill, victory is ours.

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:52.300
Don't make it sound easy!

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:56.970
You little...

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.180
Now!

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:00.560
Yeah, I know!

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:10.570
You damn punks!

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:21.210
Soji!

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:23.880
Now it's your turn!

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:30.600
What?

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:52.490
Hey, Maika. Is it ready?

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:53.950
Huh? Is what ready?

00:07:54.610 --> 00:07:55.780
The blasting powder.

00:07:57.180 --> 00:07:58.700
We're all loaded up.

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:02.490
Let's make a nice, clean path for Keiichiro.

00:08:02.490 --> 00:08:05.290
Why are you helping that guy so much?

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:07.850
It's not for him.

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:09.510
This is my battle.

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:20.310
My battle's lasted for 21 years.

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:24.520
<b>I still owe 
one million ryo 
on this airship!</b>

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:23.100
You're a real pain.

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:24.520
I don't mind that, though.

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:27.190
Let's light up some nice, big fireworks!

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:36.620
Old man Ryoma!

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:40.120
You take care of the rest, Mr. Best in Japan!

00:08:51.310 --> 00:08:53.080
What's going on?

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:55.050
Divine providence. This will get rid of the guards.

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:57.260
Kiriko-dono is just up ahead!

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:01.000
Are you okay?

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:02.400
We'll save you now!

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:03.770
Stay back!

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:11.150
You girls are such good friends.

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:14.280
But...

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:17.160
You're in the way.

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:23.050
Stop it!

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:27.400
You were born to be connected to a demon.

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:33.130
You've been led here by fate, 
too, not just the boy.

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:35.590
My fate?

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:39.420
The boy will be arriving soon.

00:10:16.070 --> 00:10:17.120
You're here, then?

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:19.840
Susanoo, avatar of rage.

00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:24.680
Shigeyoshi!

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:28.150
You are the one who carries the 
cursed blood of the Tokugawa?

00:10:28.150 --> 00:10:30.020
That doesn't matter.

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:31.520
Where's Kiriko?

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:48.500
You bastard!

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:52.310
I can feel your rage!

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:54.460
I've been waiting for that rage!

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:57.800
Shigeyoshi!

00:11:00.020 --> 00:11:02.300
Grannie! The sun!

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:07.350
It's like the light's being 
swallowed by the darkness.

00:11:10.680 --> 00:11:12.310
Behold the heavens!

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:13.400
What?

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:15.960
The demons seek the world of darkness,

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:18.460
and the gods seek the world of light.

00:11:18.460 --> 00:11:23.410
And the Onigami control both 
the light and the darkness.

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:25.950
So what?

00:11:26.440 --> 00:11:29.580
You're such a fool. Don't you understand?

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:32.650
Heaven's Lightning Wave!

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:40.800
Keiichiro-sama!

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:55.510
Did you see that?

00:11:55.510 --> 00:11:57.590
That is the limit of his power.

00:11:57.590 --> 00:12:00.400
The true Onigami is Takemikazuchi.

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:02.030
You must live by my side!

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:04.240
I'm not going with you!

00:12:08.150 --> 00:12:13.750
I'd rather die than betray Keiichiro-sama 
and follow the path of darkness.

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:16.080
Is that your answer?

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:20.670
I believe in Keiichiro-sama 
from the bottom of my heart.

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:24.990
Keiichiro-sama!

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:28.010
Keiichiro-sama!

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:31.840
Kiriko!

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:37.980
Behold!

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:41.780
Behold as a man dies for you!

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:46.570
Heaven's Lightning Wave!

00:12:53.300 --> 00:12:54.810
Keiichiro-sama...

00:12:57.440 --> 00:12:58.500
Well?

00:12:58.870 --> 00:13:00.630
Live for me!

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:05.800
Then I shall sacrifice you and 
make your death my sustenance.

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:14.910
Spirits wander this realm for eternity,

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:17.100
becoming vengeful spirits

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:19.750
that forever curse the living

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:23.070
who drove them to defeat and death.

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:27.090
That is karma!

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:32.330
The vengeful spirits of centuries 
past shall call the darkness!

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:48.220
Your death will cause the 
Onigami's blood to boil!

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:50.220
Stop!

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:32.720
Curse your own limits!

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:35.060
You bastard!

00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:39.980
I shall carry that curse, and walk 
the path of demons to Hell!

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:44.440
I do not carry my sins into Hell.

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:46.800
Honor is with me.

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:49.700
Fall to Hell with me!

00:14:50.270 --> 00:14:53.780
You bastard!

00:14:55.150 --> 00:14:57.110
Behold the heavens!

00:14:57.110 --> 00:14:59.340
The death of the sacrifice 
has brought the darkness!

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:02.650
Honor lies with the demons.

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:07.230
Because this power is righteous, 
men fear the darkness,

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:09.530
and foolishly try to drive it away!

00:15:22.390 --> 00:15:24.470
Your rage is boiling!

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:26.420
Your anger is rising!

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:29.530
The demon devours the rage and curses of men,

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:32.280
and gains the power to surpass god!

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:45.000
Die!

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:48.010
Thunderous Lightning Bolt!

00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:08.360
I have obtained eternal power.

00:16:10.770 --> 00:16:12.770
I thought I was going to die.

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:16.260
Jeez, you wrecked my ship!

00:16:16.260 --> 00:16:17.460
You'll have to pay for that!

00:16:17.460 --> 00:16:18.910
Sorry, sorry.

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:21.200
But for now, we've gotta get out of here.

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:23.050
Is that...

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:33.080
Keiichiro-sama...

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:39.970
Keiichiro-sama...

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:42.360
Kiriko?

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:44.260
What is this place?

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:48.640
Did we die?

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:51.360
You mustn't give up.

00:16:52.850 --> 00:16:53.930
That's right.

00:16:54.550 --> 00:16:57.120
I wanted to save you.

00:16:57.840 --> 00:17:01.080
I want to save you, too.

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:03.800
So let's go.

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:07.290
We have something we must do.

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:11.050
Yeah. Let's go, Kiriko.

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:39.600
The Onigami is

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:45.040
the power of darkness, destroyed because 
it refused to stray from the path of honor.

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:47.860
And I will go to Hell,

00:17:47.860 --> 00:17:50.500
and bring honor from its depths 
together with the Onigami.

00:17:51.190 --> 00:17:53.100
The Onigami is the power of darkness.

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:57.720
Terror of that darkness is what 
will truly rule this country!

00:17:58.190 --> 00:18:00.010
That's not what the Onigami are!

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:02.410
<b>Demon</b>

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:02.830
<b>Soul</b>

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:03.080
<b>Heart</b>

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:03.770
<b>Love</b>

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:05.040
Susanoo!

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:06.520
Heavenly Thunder God!

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:18.240
<b>Susanoo Heavenly Thunder God</b>

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:21.510
Kiriko, you're the only one for me.

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:24.410
Yes, and you're the only one for me.

00:18:25.280 --> 00:18:27.410
Susanoo taught us that.

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:29.200
Yeah, Kiriko.

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:30.930
The two of us can do this.

00:18:31.490 --> 00:18:32.670
Let's go, Susanoo!

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:36.170
What?

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:37.390
I saw it!

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:40.060
The Onigami were writhing in pain

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:43.110
as they raised their hands toward 
the light to escape from Hell!

00:18:43.110 --> 00:18:46.600
They were doing the best they could, 
just like the people of this world!

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:50.270
The Onigami don't seek anger.

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:51.600
What they want is a heart!

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:53.840
A warm heart!

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:56.400
A strong desire to save someone!

00:18:56.790 --> 00:18:58.400
The demons want to be saved, too.

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:03.240
So I'll offer my hand to save them from Hell!

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:07.450
That's what it means to 
be the best man in Japan!

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:14.200
Grannie!

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:16.670
Yeah, that has to be Susanoo.

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:19.010
The Onigami has awakened.

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:20.880
I've been waiting for this.

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:24.300
He was born for this moment.

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:26.260
That power is the boss's?

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:29.730
Yes, the power of the Tokugawa!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:33.100
You're making me hot.

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:37.240
This is Keiichiro's power?

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:39.520
How exciting!

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:44.620
You bastard! That power...

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:45.960
Let's go, Kiriko!

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:46.490
Right!

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:53.040
Secret Technique!

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:57.550
Heaven's Thunder Fist!

00:20:24.650 --> 00:20:26.810
Susanoo, huh? Interesting.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:33.830
That is the power of the light.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:37.410
That was a good way to stave off boredom.

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:48.090
I really thought we were going to die.

00:20:48.090 --> 00:20:50.410
Takemikazuchi has been recovered.

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:52.520
Let's get back to Edo.

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:56.510
The war is just beginning!

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:02.820
Keiichiro-sama, look.

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:04.780
Kei-chan!

00:21:05.480 --> 00:21:06.490
Boss!

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:08.030
You did it!

00:21:08.030 --> 00:21:09.370
Yeah!

00:21:09.370 --> 00:21:10.830
I'm the best in Japan!

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:16.740
<i>This is a story of monsters, 
told in the land of the rising sun.</i>

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:21.580
<i>And the story of a man,</i>

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:26.680
<i>before he awoke to take over Japan 
with the power of the Onigami.</i>

00:21:27.520 --> 00:21:29.260
<i>That man's name is...</i>

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:30.560
Keiichiro!

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:32.670
You're finally going to Edo, then?

00:21:32.670 --> 00:21:33.960
Yeah.

00:21:33.960 --> 00:21:37.520
I'm the 17th Shogun of the Edo Shogunate,

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:40.230
Tokugawa Keiichiro!
